f("DFM-1","core","blocker",["J4","J5"],[],"Core's CONN-TH_XDJK-0271-1650 footprint has only the 3 pin holes and no holes for the jack's 2 locating posts. Lite's copy has NPTH 1.7x2.4 ovals at (+-7.65,+1.60). The courtyards differ too (core x+-8,y-3.45..21.8; Lite x-8.75..12.3,y-4.3..15.2).","Board dump of J4/J5 vs lite J2/J3. Lian Xin drawing A-AV2-7A1 (LCSC C7527522): 3-dia1.6 pin holes plus 2-2X3 post holes; pins 4.5 mm below the base, snap-in side legs 3.5 mm. With the legs standing on the board the pins enter only 1.0 mm of the 1.6 mm board.","Use Lite's footprint on core and enlarge the post holes to 2.0x3.0 NPTH slots per the drawing. Re-run courtyard/DRC.","Pin protrusion -0.6 mm (1.0 mm into a 1.6 mm board)")
f("DFM-2","both","major",["J2","J3","J4","J5"],[],"RCA post holes are 1.7x2.4, smaller than the drawing's 2.0x3.0. The footprint's signal pins sit on rows 0.8 mm apart (y -1.95/-1.15); the drawing shows both on one row 8 mm apart.","Drawing A-AV2-7A1. Pin 1.0x0.3 brass (diagonal 1.04) in 1.6 hole = 0.28 mm radial slack against a possible 0.8 mm position error.","Check a real part against a 1:1 print, or buy 2 pcs of C7527522 first. Make the post holes 2.0x3.0. If the pins mismatch, make pins 1/3 plated 1.6x2.4 ovals along y.","Unverified: slack 0.28 mm vs a possible 0.8 mm error")
k("XDJK-0271-1650 pin hole positions match EasyEDA land pattern (pins 1/3 rows 0.8 mm apart)","both",["J2","J3","J4","J5"],"unverified","Lian Xin A-AV2-7A1 (drawing ambiguous)",True)
k("XDJK-0271-1650 needs 2 post holes 2.0x3.0","both",["J2","J3","J4","J5"],"verified","Lian Xin A-AV2-7A1 '2-2X3'",True)
f("DFM-3","core","major",["U15","U16"],["GND"],"No heatsink mounting holes for the TPA3221. The DDV package's thermal slug is on TOP and needs a grounded heatsink; core has only the 4 corner M3 holes.","TI SLASEE9C sec 5 + pin table (PowerPAD on top, connect to grounded heatsink); RthJA 44.8 C/W no heatsink vs 5.5 C/W with heatsink -> Tj 150 C at 2.5 W from 40 C ambient (~22 W total out at 90% eff).","Add 2x M3 3.2 mm PTH GND holes per amp either side of U15/U16 (~25-30 mm apart), keep a ~30x20 mm area clear of parts taller than 1.5 mm, put the heatsink in the BOM as hand-fit.","2.5 W dissipation limit without a heatsink")
f("DFM-4","core","major",["U18"],["/IR_IN"],"U18 IRM-H638T is a top-looking SMD IR receiver (lens on top) 3 mm from the bottom edge. Under a Plus lid it needs a window or light pipe at least ~21.6 mm tall; Lite uses a front-facing THT IRM-3638T.","Everlight DMO-0000008 rev3 p6 top view shows the lens; tallest core part is C5/C6 at 20 mm (C88733). Land pattern: Everlight wants pads at +-3.15, the footprint has +-2.95 (toe 0.2 mm vs 0.4).","Use the IRM-3638T THT front-facing receiver (C42421366) at the front edge like Lite, or put a window in the lid within +-45 deg above U18.","Lid >= 21.6 mm above the board")
f("DFM-5","both","note",["C5","C6","C311","J1"],[],"3D models: core names models for 278/282 footprints and 241 exist (36 C0603 + SC-70 missing). Lite's 26 aiee model paths point at a lib/aiee.3dshapes that doesn't exist. The 470 uF model is H16 against a real 20 mm part.","Board footprint model fields checked against the files; LCSC C88733 D10xL20.","Copy aiee.3dshapes to Lite and fix the 470 uF model height to 20 mm before any enclosure-height check.","4 mm understatement on the tallest part")
