f("DFM-6","core","major",["J1"],["VBUS_IN","/power_in/CC1","/power_in/CC2"],"New USB4085-GF-A (THT, C7095263): GCT's and EasyEDA's pattern is a 0.40 drill in a 0.65 pad, annulus 0.125 mm, below JLC's multilayer PTH absolute minimum of 0.15. At 0.85 pitch, a 0.70 pad (KiCad lib) gives a 0.15 annulus and a 0.15 pad gap. THT at JLC is hand/selective solder; 16 joints at 0.85 pitch risk VBUS-CC bridges under the shell.","GCT USB4085 rev B sheet 2; EasyEDA C7095263 pad hole r=0.787 units (0.40 mm), pad 0.65; JLC capabilities (fetched 2026-10-28): multilayer PTH annulus min 0.15, recommended 0.20; hole tol +0.13/-0.08 -> 0.32 worst finished vs 0.32 max contact diagonal.","Use 0.70 pads on 0.40 drills. Edge 1.74 mm in front of the rear slot centres (rear slots at x 36.327 for core's edge 34.587). Order remark: selective/hand solder, inspect A4-A5/B4-B5/B8-B9 for bridges. Bring-up: ohm CC1/CC2 to VBUS before PD.","Annulus 0.15 vs 0.15 min (0 %); pad gap 0.15; worst-case hole/pin clearance 0 mm")
f("DFM-7","lite-main","minor",["J1"],["VBUS"],"New HRO TYPE-C-31-M-12 (C165948) is rated 20 V / 5 A, -30..+80 C. Lite runs up to a 20 V PD contract (SMBJ20A), so the rating margin is 0 % (PD allows 21 V). Shell slot pads in HRO's pattern are 0.9 mm (annulus 0.15 < JLC 2-layer 0.18 min). The edge must be 5.79 mm in front of the peg centres.","HRO TYPE-C-31-M-12 drawing rev A 2020-12-08 (LCSC C165948 datasheet); EasyEDA C165948 model; KiCad USB_C_Receptacle_HRO_TYPE-C-31-M-12.","Pull the EasyEDA/KiCad footprint (1.0-1.2 mm shell pads), put the pegs 5.79 mm from the top edge (pegs at y 66.113 for edge 60.323), use the 1.4 mm rear slot, re-run cpl_verify. Accept the 20 V rating or cap PD at 15 V if the power review allows.","Voltage rating 20 V vs 21 V max PD (-5 %); annulus 0.2 with 1.0 pads vs 0.18 min (11 %)")
