f("DFM-12","core","major",["U19"],["/linein/OPT_VCC","/OPT_SPDIF"],"Ultra U19 is ordered as PLR237/T8BK (C17223620) on a PLR237/T10BK footprint. The T8BK has two 1.70 mm locating posts (5.60 apart) with no holes, so the part sits about 1.7 mm high and tilted. Pin numbering is mirrored between T8 (1=Vout,3=Vcc) and T10 (1=VCC,3=VOUT) but physically the same, so the present nets are right; any renumbering must keep the physical Vcc pin on OPT_VCC.","Everlight DPL-0000262/263 rev1 p5 (T8BK) vs DPL-0000261 rev1 p5 (T10BK); board dump of U19 (0.914 x3, 1.1 x2, no 1.7 holes); T10BK C17427482 stock 0.","Make a T8BK footprint: add 2x 1.70 holes at +-2.80, 2.61 beyond the NC row; re-check the port-to-edge offset (T8 side view 5.88 vs T10 6.14); keep the physical Vcc pin on OPT_VCC.","Post height 1.70 mm with 0 mm clearance")
